      "num_turns": 16,
      "result": "Implemented the Laravel 11 URL shortener API with MySQL-backed link storage and click tracking. The endpoints are registered at the required root paths, and `start.sh` applies migrations before serving on `0.0.0.0:8000` with `--no-reload`. The README explains how to start it.\n\nVerified the API over HTTP: link creation, duplicate-code conflict, lookup, redirect and click increment, malformed JSON and invalid-URL responses, and listing. A created link and its click count remained after restarting the server. `php artisan test` passed (2 tests).\n\nThe generated Laravel project includes its standard dependency set; Composer reported security advisories during installation, which I did not investigate further.",
